<span id="S4.F3.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:15.63em;">
<span id="S4.F3.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.F3.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The IL model repeats the identical failed action for over 30 steps until termination. Having never seen failure states during imitation learning, it has no mechanism to diagnose the error or propose an alternative.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
          
